{"id":43867,"date":"2025-07-31T14:08:45","date_gmt":"2025-07-31T13:08:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vulcan-trail-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-08-23T23:55:06","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:55:06","slug":"vulcan-trail-2026","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vulcan-trail-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Vulcan Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O Grupo Desportivo de Igreja Nova ir\u00e1 organizar, a 4 de Janeiro de 2026, pelas 09h00, a quarta<br>edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Vulcan Trail na Igreja Nova, concelho de Mafra. O Vulcan Trail 2026 \u00e9 uma prova de<br>TrailRunning, corrida pedestre em natureza, com tr\u00eas provas, Trail Longo (TL) K20+, Trail Curto<br>(TC) K12+ e caminhada, inserida na segunda edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Mafra Trail Running Series.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Com partida e chegada na localidade de Igreja Nova, concelho de Mafra, distrito de Lisboa, visa<br>a promo\u00e7\u00e3o e divulga\u00e7\u00e3o tur\u00edstica e ambiental da regi\u00e3o, e da promo\u00e7\u00e3o do desporto em meio<br>natural.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":43868,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-43867","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-igreja-nova-mafra","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/pop_33t50r6894.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/43867","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}